# UI Global (Sanitized)

This file provides a public-safe overview of the shared UI layers that span game modes.

## Overview
- Centralizes top-level menus, notifications, and persistent overlays.
- Ensures consistent styling through the sanitized theme lexicon interface.
- Coordinates save-state aware prompts without describing protected flows.

## Sanitized Notes
- Mission briefings, entitlement checks, and network-dependent dialogs have been removed.
- Detailed sequence diagrams for onboarding and error recovery live in the restricted archive.
- Consult internal UX guidelines for localization keys and compliance requirements.
